<title>PORTUGAL: Trade resumes in Portugal Telecom.</title>
<headline>Trade resumes in Portugal Telecom.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share trade will resume in Portugal Telecom at 1242 GMT, the Lisbon bourse said.</p>
<p>Business had been suspended because of a wrongly-inserted order. The bourse said that it was annulling trades carried out between 12.03:58 and 12.04:37 GMT on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon bureau, 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
